# Linux platform

Hosted Linux SDKs and providers implemented over libc and the Linux userspace
kernel ABI. Audio uses SDL2's queued devices on Linux SDKs; only
applications importing mm.audio link that library. SDL2 also provides an
alternative display and touch backend selected by a board.
